(Muara Logistics Sdn Bhd - Operations, Compliance and Sustainability Manual \(2026 edition\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FICTIONAL SAMPLE DOCUMENT. Muara Logistics is a fictional company created for the Freight Ops) Tj T*
(Copilot portfolio project. Rules below are simplified examples written for the demo; always) Tj T*
(verify regulatory requirements with the Royal Malaysian Customs Department \(JKDM\), the relevant) Tj T*
(ministries and the port operators before acting on them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1. Company Profile and Services) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 Muara Logistics is a third-party logistics \(3PL\) provider based in Pulau Indah, Port Klang,) Tj T*
(Selangor. We provide ground handling for international freight forwarders: customs clearance,) Tj T*
(container haulage from Westport and Northport, warehousing and final delivery anywhere in) Tj T*
(Peninsular Malaysia, plus coastal shipping coordination to Sabah and Sarawak.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2 Our core commodities are chemicals \(including dangerous goods\), palm oil and palm-based) Tj T*
(products, and plastics \(polymer resins and finished plastic goods\). General cargo is also) Tj T*
(accepted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.3 We operate two warehouses: a general cargo warehouse of 4,000 pallet positions in Pulau) Tj T*
(Indah and a licensed dangerous-goods \(DG\) store of 800 pallet positions with segregated bays) Tj T*
(and bunded floors.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2. Customs Clearance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1 Import shipments are declared on Customs Form K1 and export shipments on Customs Form K2,) Tj T*
(submitted electronically through the uCustoms system. Transshipment and movement of goods) Tj T*
(between customs areas use Form K8.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.2 A customs declaration must be supported by the commercial invoice, packing list, bill of) Tj T*
(lading or air waybill, and any import or export permits required for the goods. Missing permits) Tj T*
(are the most common cause of clearance delays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.3 The clearance team must submit the declaration no later than 24 hours after the vessel) Tj T*
(discharge schedule is confirmed. Shipments selected for physical inspection must be moved to) Tj T*
(the inspection bay within the same working day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.4 Duties and sales tax are paid by the importer of record. Muara Logistics may advance duty) Tj T*
(payments only with written approval from the Finance Manager and a signed indemnity from the) Tj T*
(forwarder.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3. Dangerous Goods - Chemicals) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 Every chemical shipment requires a Safety Data Sheet \(SDS\) no older than five years and a) Tj T*
(dangerous goods declaration stating the UN number, proper shipping name, hazard class and) Tj T*
(packing group.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 Containers carrying dangerous goods must display the correct hazard placards on all four) Tj T*
(sides. Drivers carrying DG must hold a valid GDL \(goods driving licence\) with DG endorsement) Tj T*
(and carry the SDS and emergency response information in the cab.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
