(3.3 Segregation rules in the DG store: Class 3 flammable liquids must be stored at least 3) Tj T*
(metres away from Class 5.1 oxidisers; Class 8 corrosives must be stored on bunded floors; Class) Tj T*
(2 gas cylinders must be stored upright and chained. Incompatible classes must never share a) Tj T*
(bay.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.4 Westport and Northport limit how long dangerous goods may stay in the terminal. Our rule:) Tj T*
(DG containers are collected within 24 hours of discharge and never parked at our yard overnight) Tj T*
(unless inside the licensed DG area.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.5 Chemical jobs carry a dangerous-goods surcharge of 25 percent on haulage and a DG) Tj T*
(documentation fee per container.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.6 Any spill or leak must be reported immediately to the Operations Manager and the Department) Tj T*
(of Environment hotline. Use the spill kits located at every DG bay and evacuate if vapour is) Tj T*
(detected.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4. Palm Oil and Palm-Based Products) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.1 Crude palm oil \(CPO\) and refined palm products move in flexitanks inside 20ft containers or) Tj T*
(in ISO tank containers. Flexitanks must be fitted by certified installers and inspected for) Tj T*
(leaks before loading.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.2 CPO solidifies at low temperatures. ISO tanks and flexitanks with heating pads must be) Tj T*
(heated to between 50 and 55 degrees Celsius before discharge; never exceed 60 degrees Celsius) Tj T*
(because it damages product quality.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.3 Export consignments must include the MSPO \(Malaysian Sustainable Palm Oil\) certificate and,) Tj T*
(where the buyer requires it, the MPOB licence number of the exporter. Shipments to the European) Tj T*
(Union also require due-diligence and traceability documents under the EU Deforestation) Tj T*
(Regulation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.4 Palm oil volumes peak during the harvest season from September to November. Planners must) Tj T*
(secure extra prime movers and flexitank stock by August each year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.5 Palm oil jobs carry a 10 percent haulage surcharge and a tank inspection and heating fee) Tj T*
(per container.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5. Plastics) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.1 Plastic resins \(polyethylene, polypropylene, PVC\) are shipped in 25 kg bags on pallets or) Tj T*
(in 1 tonne jumbo bags. Pallets must be shrink-wrapped and kept dry; resin contaminated by) Tj T*
(moisture is rejected by manufacturers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.2 Importing plastic scrap or plastic waste into Malaysia is tightly restricted and requires) Tj T*
(approval and permits from the relevant authorities. Muara Logistics does not handle plastic) Tj T*
(waste or scrap shipments under any circumstances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.3 Year-end is the peak season for plastics as manufacturers build stock before Chinese New) Tj T*
(Year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
