(9.3 Quotes are valid for 7 days because diesel prices change weekly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 10. Sustainability and ESG) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10.1 Muara Logistics commits to reduce fleet emissions per TEU moved by 30 percent by 2030) Tj T*
(against a 2024 baseline, through rail modal shift, route optimisation and newer Euro 5 prime) Tj T*
(movers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10.2 Emissions are calculated from actual diesel consumption using 2.68 kg of CO2 per litre of) Tj T*
(diesel. Every quotation shows the estimated CO2e next to the price.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10.3 Idling is limited to 5 minutes. Drivers must switch off engines while waiting in port) Tj T*
(queues.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10.4 Subcontracted hauliers must report fuel use quarterly and comply with the company code of) Tj T*
(conduct, including fair working hours and no forced labour.) Tj T*
